    {
      "id": "6af04d3854f4e1ce368179b4",
      "text": "APNG",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133306,
      "updated": 1794133306
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04ee90000000000d9f4f6",
      "text": "[Animated PNG]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133737,
      "updated": 1794133737
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04f7b0000000000d9f529",
      "text": "\t[APNGを使う]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133884,
      "updated": 1794133884
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04f7d0000000000d9f52a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133886,
      "updated": 1794133886
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e770000000000d9f4d3",
      "text": "table: ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133623,
      "updated": 1794133659
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e7a0000000000d9f4d7",
      "text": " Filename extension\t[.png], [.apng]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133626,
      "updated": 1794133668
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e7a0000000000d9f4d9",
      "text": " Internet media type\t[image/png], [image/apng], [image/vnd.mozilla.apng]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133626,
      "updated": 1794133687
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e7a0000000000d9f4dd",
      "text": " Type of format\tAnimated lossless bitmap image",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133626,
      "updated": 1794133626
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e7a0000000000d9f4de",
      "text": " Extended from\t[PNG]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133626,
      "updated": 1794133743
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e7a0000000000d9f4df",
      "text": " Open format?\tyes",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133626,
      "updated": 1794133626
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04eeb0000000000d9f4f7",
      "text": "from [APNG - Wikipedia (en) https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/APNG]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133739,
      "updated": 1794133783
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e3a0000000000d9f4cd",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133562,
      "updated": 1794133562
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04d4f0000000000d9f4c2",
      "text": "[Animated Portable Network Graphics - Wikipedia https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/Animated_Portable_Network_Graphics]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133328,
      "updated": 1794133341
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04d3a0000000000d9f4be",
      "text": " > Animated Portable Network Graphics（APNG、アニメーテッドPNG）は、コンピュータ上で[アニメーション]画像（動画）を扱うためのファイルフォーマットの1つである。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133306,
      "updated": 1794133501
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04dfc0000000000d9f4c8",
      "text": " \t> 旧来の[GIFアニメーション]および[MNG]フォーマットを代替する目的でPNGフォーマットを拡張して作られた。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133501,
      "updated": 1794133504
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e000000000000d9f4c9",
      "text": "  > 開発当初は非公式の拡張形式という扱いだったが、MNGとの規格争いに勝利し[2025年]6月24日より正式にPNGフォーマット仕様に取り入れられた。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133504,
      "updated": 1794133518
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04d620000000000d9f4c4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133347,
      "updated": 1794133352
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04d3d0000000000d9f4c1",
      "text": " > APNGフォーマットでは、最初のフレームが従来のPNGと同様の領域に格納される。そのため、APNGフォーマットに対応しないデコーダを搭載したソフトウェアでも、最初のフレームが静止画として表示される。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133309,
      "updated": 1794133350
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04d3c0000000000d9f4bf",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133308,
      "updated": 1794133308
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e4c0000000000d9f4d0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133580,
      "updated": 1794133580
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04e4e0000000000d9f4d1",
      "text": "#画像フォーマット",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133582,
      "updated": 1794133584
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04f6a0000000000d9f51b",
      "text": " Initial release\t[2004]-08-27",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133866,
      "updated": 1794133866
    },
    {
      "id": "6af04f3c0000000000d9f509",
      "text": " Developed by [Mozilla] Foundation (adopted by W3C)",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794133820,
      "updated": 1794133842
    }
  ]
}